      <p source="#source-424-450"><seg source="#source-424-450">春の神様陽気だな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-450-476"><seg source="#source-450-476">天女の羽や夢御殿</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-476-505"><seg source="#source-476-505">梅、桃、桜、色々の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-505-537"><seg source="#source-505-537">花を咲かせて楽しんだ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-537-577"><seg source="#source-537-543">なぜ</seg><choice source="#source-543-549"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-549-577">こんなに陽気だろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-577-603"><seg source="#source-577-603">夏の神様大おこり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-603-632"><seg source="#source-603-632">はげた頭を光らして</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-632-661"><seg source="#source-632-661">春の神様追ひやって</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-661-690"><seg source="#source-661-690">雷さまがおきに入り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-690-719"><seg source="#source-690-719">すきな遊びは夕立だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-719-759"><seg source="#source-719-725">なぜ</seg><choice source="#source-725-731"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-731-759">こんなに怒るだろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-759-788"><seg source="#source-759-788">秋の神様やさしいな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-788-820"><seg source="#source-788-800">風をそよ</seg><choice source="#source-800-806"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-806-820">野に送り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-820-846"><seg source="#source-820-846">七夕さまや天の川</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-846-881"><seg source="#source-846-881">銀のお月さんぬっと出る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-881-927"><seg source="#source-881-887">なぜ</seg><choice source="#source-887-893"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-893-927">こんなにやさしいだろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-927-953"><seg source="#source-927-953">冬の神様陰気だな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-953-988"><seg source="#source-953-988">寒いこがらしお気に入り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-988-1020"><seg source="#source-988-1020">いつもしぶい顔ばかり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1020-1058"><seg source="#source-1020-1026">なぜ</seg><choice source="#source-1026-1032"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-1032-1058">こんなに陰気だろ</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1058-1112" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1076-1112"><seg source="#source-1076-1112">大正十一年四月二十一日綴</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
